[This is ./cmfonts/cmtest/0_READ_ME.]This directory contains only the test files for work onthe Computer Modern fonts.  The source files, and mostrelated files are in the directory ./cmfonts at the main level of this distribution.cmfonts consists of ./cmfonts/cmtest./cmfonts/mf./cmfonts/pk./cmfonts/gf./cmfonts/pk/pk120./cmfonts/pk/pk240./cmfonts/pk/pk300./cmfonts/pk/pk300wThe parallel directories utilityfonts and LaTeXfonts have a similar structure. The latter contains the special LaTeX and SliTeX fonts.